// Copy this file to `Signing.xcconfig` (gitignored) and fill in your own
// team ID. `project.yml` points every configuration at `Signing.xcconfig` via
// `configFiles`, so `xcodegen generate` needs the file to exist, but its
// *contents* are deliberately not committed — the team ID is specific to
// whoever is signing the build, the same reason the macOS signing identity
// is not in `tauri.conf.json`. See HANDOVER.md §6 for the build that made
// this necessary and the one that made a committed team ID the wrong fix
// before it.
//
// Find your team ID in Xcode: Settings → Accounts → your Apple ID → your
// team → the parenthesised ID next to its name.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic
